WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.580
A country house.

2
00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:05.190
At a window, a figure
looks out over the fields.

3
00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:08.520
Below, small figures bend over the ground.

4
00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:12.320
Far off, a city street,
lined with chimneys.

5
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:14.120
Two arrows appear.

6
00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:15.420
Who owns this?

7
00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:16.960
And who works here?

8
00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:19.840
Fair questions for a
novel about a factory.

9
00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:22.490
But why would a critic
ask them of a love story,

10
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:23.850
or a poem?

11
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:27.500
In this mission, you'll meet
Marxist ideas in outline:

12
00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:30.360
class, labour, ideology.

13
00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:32.940
You'll stand with farm
workers on a cold morning,

14
00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:37.200
beside a threshing-machine, and
ask who is really in control.

15
00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:41.480
And you'll learn to tell a real Marxist
reading from a comment that just mentions

16
00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:42.510
money.

17
00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:46.690
Your mission: work out who owns
what, and who works for whom.
